  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Autoclave the above solution at 121C for 15 minutes."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "Cool to 55C."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Aseptically add the following, freshly prepared, filter-sterilized solutions in the order listed:"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "comment": "This medium solidifies very quickly and should be maintained at 50-55C while dispensing."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "comment": "Aseptically tube the sterile completed medium under an anaerobic atmosphere of 80% N2, 10% CO2, 10% H2. Plug the tubes with butyl rubber stoppers."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "comment": "A note of caution: Hydrogen gas can be explosive in the concentration used in preparing this medium."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "comment": "Gas tanks should be equipped with spark arrestors."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "comment": "Dissolve KOH in water. Add ethanol and hemin."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "comment": "Dissolve menadione in ethanol; then add water. Filter-sterilize solution."
    }
  ]
}